  your energy\, and join us as we migrate to Thrive City’s Valkyries Play
 offs Watch Party\, presented by Kaiser Permanente!\n\n4PM — Check-In: Ki
 ck things off at Pier 48 Ferry Dock (402 Terry A Francois Blvd).\n4:30PM 
 — The March: Follow our bestie Violet\, local San Francisco lowriders\, 
 and special guests straight over to Thrive City.\nWatch Party: Settle in f
 or the Valkyries Playoffs Watch Party presented by Kaiser Permanente\, bro
 adcasting live on the big plaza board!\n\nLate arrivals are encouraged to 
 head straight to Thrive City where seating will be available on a first-co
 me\, first-served basis.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/
 march-to-ballhalla-tickets-2001629942039?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https
