SUMMARY:Japanese Tea Garden’s Free Admission Hour (Golden Gate Park)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T100000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1633027@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerJapanese Tea Garden’s Free A
 dmission Hour (Golden Gate Park)The Japanese Tea Garden provides visitors 
 from around the world with an opportunity to experience the natural beauty
 \, tranquility\, and harmony of a Japanese-style garden in the heart of Sa
 n Francisco’s Golden Gate Park.\nOriginally created as a “Japanese Vil
 lage” exhibit for the 1894 California Midwinter International Exposition
 \, the Japanese Tea Garden endures as one of the most popular attractions 
 in San Francisco\, featuring classic elements such as an arched drum bridg
 e\, pagodas\, stone lanterns\, stepping stone paths\, native Japanese plan
 ts\, serene koi ponds\, and a zen garden. Cherry blossom trees bloom throu
 ghout the garden in March and April.\n\nAdmission to the Japanese Tea Gard
 en is free for San Francisco residents with valid ID. Free hours for every
 one (even non-residents) are 9-10 am every Monday\, Wednesday and Friday.\
 nPlease note that hours and costs change frequently.\nJapanese Tea Garden\
 n75 Hagiwara Tea Garden\, Golden Gate Park\, SF\nFREE for San Francisco Re
 sidents w/ ID\nFREE for Everyone from 9-10 am on Mondays\, Wednesdays and 
 Fridays\nNon Resident Fees\nAdults: $12-16 (depends on season)\n(February 
 – November) $14\n(December – January) $12\n(Weekends year-round) $16\n
 Seniors (ages 65+ w/ID) $7\nYouth (ages 12-17) $7\nChildren (ages 5-11) $3
 \nChildren (under 5) FREE\nHours Of Operation\nLast entry 30 minutes befor
 e closing\nSpring – Summer Hours\nMarch – October\n9am – 5:45pm\nFal
 l – Winter Ho...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.japaneseteagardensf.com
 /vist\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/japanese-tea-gardens-free-admissio
 n-hour-golden-gate-park-442/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/japane
 seteagarden-scaled-e1595352236641.jpeg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/japanese-tea-gardens-free-admission-hour-golde
 n-gate-park-442/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Parenting Workshop: Decode Your Child’s Behavior (Mill Vall
 ey)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T100000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638176@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Kids Families
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBehind the Behavior: Understan
 ding Your Child at Every Developmental Stage and What You Might See at Hom
 e\nFriday\, October 2\, 2026\n9:00-10:00 a.m. / Marin Horizon School Libra
 ry\nWhen we think about the beginning of the school year\, we think about 
 new teachers\, new friends\, new expectations\, and all of the logistics o
 f parenting a school-aged child. And then comes the push for more independ
 ence\, the nightly meltdown that didn’t happen last year\, or the “ple
 ase don’t talk to me in front of my friends.” We may find ourselves wo
 ndering what happened and how did we get here? It’s easy to feel lost wh
 en our children enter a new developmental stage. We may understand what to
  expect from a parenting book or article\, but it can be much harder to re
 cognize and respond to these changes when they show up at home. In this wo
 rkshop\, we’ll explore the developmental stages of the elementary and mi
 ddle school years\, what to expect as children grow and change\, and pract
 ical ways to navigate these new phases while strengthening communication\,
  connection\, and understanding with your child.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https
 ://www.marinhorizon.org/student-life/parent-education\nDetails: https://sf
 .funcheap.com/free-parenting-workshop-decode-childs-behavior-mill-valley/\
 nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screen
 shot-2026-09-22-at-12.15.26-PM.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Marin Horizon School\, 305 Montford Ave\, Mill Valley CA 94941
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-parenting-workshop-decode-childs-behavior
 -mill-valley/
END:VEVENT
