 d in person tickets might be available at the membership desk\n\nThis offe
 r applies only to general admission for the permanent collection galleries
 .\nFull-priced admission to special exhibitions still applies.\nFor: Resid
 ents of Alameda\, Contra Costa\, Marin\, Napa\, San Francisco\, San Mateo\
 , Santa Clara\, Solano\, and Sonoma Counties with valid photo ID or postma
 rked envelope bearing home address\n\nVisitors ages 17 and under always re
 ceive free admission to the permanent collection galleries.\nPlease note t
 his free Saturdays offer could be changed or canceled at anytime. Visit de
