 re Island Art Studios into an immersive world of glowing sculpture\, colla
 borative art\, creativity and play.\nOn Wonder Sundays\, visitors of all a
 ges are invited to step inside the transformed galleries\, explore large-s
 cale handmade and illuminated installations\, create art\, respond to play
 ful prompts\, and add their own contributions to an evolving collaborative
  environment.\n\nThis isn’t an exhibition where you simply look at the a
 rt—you’re invited to become part of it. Draw\, paint\, play\, explore 
 and follow your curiosity. As visitors add their creations throughout Octo
 ber\, the installation itself continues to grow and change.\nCreated by ar
 tist Priscila Soares and The Letting Go Art Experience\, Step Into Wonder 
 is an invitation to reconnect with creativity\, imagination and the freedo
 m to make without worrying about getting it “right.”\nWonder Sundays: 
 October 4\, 11\, 18 & 25\, 12–4 PMAll ages • Free admissionMare Island
  Art Studios\, 110 Pintado St.\, Vallejo\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://thele
