 door recreation area at the Golden Gate Park Senior Center (6101 Fulton St
 reet) on Tuesday\, October 6 from 2 to 3 p.m. The project will add fitness
  equipment\, seating and flexible space on the small lawn behind the cente
 r for activities such as dance\, tai chi\, yoga and Zumba. Note that the S
 enior Center parking lot will be closed that day for the event. Learn more
  about the project at the link in the bio! #sanfrancisco #goldengatepark #
 goldengateparkseniorcenter\n@sfrecpark\nSan Francisco Recreation & Parks\n
