DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerJohn Luther Dela CruzFleet Wee
 k Liberty Call at Question Mark Tavern\nJoin the Navy\, see the world… f
 rom a mile offshore through a porthole.\n\nNot this cruise! It’s liberty
  call\, and we’re buying the drinks!\nThis Friday\, October 9\, Navy vet
 eran-owned Question Mark Tavern welcomes Fleet Week with all-day specials:
 \n* Active duty E-5 and below in uniform: FREE beer and well drinks\n* Act
 ive duty E-6 and above in uniform: 50% off beer and well drinks\n* Veteran
 s and first responders: 50% off beer and well drinks\nUniform required for
  active-duty specials. No exceptions.\nKitchen: 11 AM–2:30 PM and 5 PM
 –2 AM\nHappy Hour: 5–7 PM\nCome hungry\, bring your shipmates\, and ma
 ke yourself at home.\nNavy veteran owned. San Francisco raised.\nQuestion 
 Mark Tavern\n312 Harriet Street\, San Francisco\n@questionmarktavern\n\nFr
 ee\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/DeKUItBI1MN/?utm_source=ig_web_
 copy_link&amp\;stkn=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/fle
 et-week-liberty-call-free-drinks-activeduty-e5s-soma/\nSource: Funcheap SF
