DESCRIPTION:Category: Festivals / ParadesContact Phone: (650) 724-5544Cont
 act Email: info@unaff.orgLink: www.unaff.orgThe 29th United Nations Associ
 ation Film Festival closes on Sunday\, Oct. 25\, at Mitchell Park in Palo 
 Alto\, bringing two feature-length films.Yo (Love is a Rebellious Bird)\, 
 by Bay Area duo Banker White and UNAFF alum Anna Fitch\, is an imaginative
  film explores creativity as an outlet for grief and love.In the Company o
 f Wolves: An American Journey\, narrated by Jeff Bridges and directed by S
 usan Kucera and Jim Swift\, explores how our relationship with animals sha
 ped a nation. Jeff Bridges is also the recipient of the 29th UNAFF Visiona
 ry Award.\n\nPublished by KGO\nContains information from CalDiscovery (cal
 discovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nSource: CalDiscovery
