DESCRIPTION:Join KALW & CalMatters for a live voter guide presentation tha
 t will answer your questions about the candidates & issues on the Nov. bal
 lot.\n\nDo you have questions about the election? Where do the candidates 
 stand on the issues? What does the insurance commissioner do?\n\nPlease jo
 in KALW as we welcome the nonprofit statewide publication CalMatters to br
 eakdown\, analyze\, and answer your burning questions about this year’s 
 primary election\, in a conversation centered around the latest edition of
  their Voter Guide.\n\nDan Hu manages strategic partnerships at CalMatters
 \, a nonprofit publication focused on California’s statewide issues. Pre
 viously\, Dan was the executive director of The Yappie\, a nonprofit publi
 cation focused on AAPI political news. Through his service on the boards o
 f LION Publishers and the Glen Nelson Center at American Public Media Grou
 p\, Dan is focused on supporting local news across the country.\n\nThere i
 s a $10 - $20 sliding scale suggested donation for this event. Nobody will
  be turned away for lack of funds.\n\nPlease become a KALW member today an
 d receive your first drink on us at all 220 Montgomery events.\n\nFree\nKA
 LW Public Media\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2
 Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fvoting-matters-california-voter-guide-live-with-
 calmatters-tickets-2002474941455%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator%26keep_tld%3Dtrue\n
 Details: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/9/voting-matters-california-v
 oter-guide-live-with-calmatters-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
