DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerLooking for a co-founder or st
 artup collaborator? This San Francisco event skips profile-based matching 
 and puts participants to work together on real startup problems.\nBefore t
 he event\, attendees submit one challenge they are currently facing. Durin
 g the evening\, the room votes on selected problems and small groups work 
 through them in focused sessions.\nEach session gives participants a chanc
 e to see how potential collaborators think\, communicate\, challenge assum
 ptions\, and solve problems in real time.\nThe event is designed for solo 
 founders\, engineers\, builders\, product professionals\, GTM operators\, 
 and startup professionals interested in finding potential co-founders or c
 ollaborators.\nAt the end of the evening\, attendees can indicate who they
  would like to continue working or talking with. Ascent Valley connects pa
 rticipants only when the interest is mutual.\nExpect two structured workin
 g sessions\, collaborative problem-solving\, open networking\, and post-ev
 ent mutual matching.\nAdvance registration and completion of a short pre-e
 vent problem submission form are required.\n\n$12.60\n\nTickets: https://l
 uma.com/founder_table_sf07\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco
 -cofounder-matching-find-partner-solving-real-problems/\nSource: Funcheap 
 SF
