 ion to reserve a spot. See you there!\n\nSeminar Locations & Dates:\n\nPet
 aluma – September 19\, 10-11am | Call 707-347-5837 to register\nConcord 
 – September 26\, 10-11am | Call 925-681-0550 to register\nNovato – Oct
 ober 3\, 10-11am | Call 415-897-2169 to register\nSloat Blvd – October 1
 0\, 10-11am | Call 415-566-4415 to register\n\nPublished by Sloat Garden C
