DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to our second annual Fall Harvest Festival!\n
 Join us for a blueberry pruning demonstration\, a succulent pumpkin worksh
 op\, and local artisans and vendors. Enjoy family friendly activities like
  a kid’s craft\, face painting\, Music Time with Farmer Arann\, and a ha
 rvest scavenger hunt. Grab a coffee or cider and listen to local bluegrass
  artists while you soak in the autumnal vibes.\nSaturday\, October 10\nAll
  festivities from 10-3pm\n10:00 AM | Blueberry Pruning Demonstration with 
 Expert Elizabeth Ruiz\n11:00 AM to 12:00 PM | Music Time with Farmer Arann
  (Interactive Kids Music)\n12:30 PM to 2:00 PM | Bluegrass Music\n2:00 PM 
 to 3:00 PM | Succulent Pumpkin Workshop\, $75/person\, please call the sto
 re to register: 415-566-4415\nThe harvest fun doesn’t stop there! Catch 
 it in Petaluma (9/19)\, Concord (9/26)\, and Novato (10/3) too.\n\nPublish
 ed by Sloat Garden Center\nContains information from CalDiscovery (caldisc
 overy.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://sloatgardens.com/event/sloat-blv
 d-sf-event-sloat-harvest-festival/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&
 utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
