BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Step Into Wonder – Deep Dive Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1634419@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerPriscila Soares\n\nGo beyond t
 he surface of creativity with Step Into Wonder: Deep Dive\, an intimate\, 
 guided art experience for adults at Mare Island Art Studios.\nLed by artis
 t Priscila Soares\, this three-hour session uses art-making\, creative pro
 mpts and reflection to explore what happens when we quiet the inner critic
 \, let go of expectations and give ourselves permission to create freely.\
 n\nNo artistic experience is needed. The focus isn’t on making something
  “good”—it’s on curiosity\, expression and discovering what can em
 erge when you stop trying to control the outcome.\nSet within the immersiv
 e Step Into Wonder installation\, surrounded by glowing sculptures and a t
 ransformed gallery environment\, the Deep Dive offers a smaller\, more int
 entional experience for those who want to explore the deeper side of The L
 etting Go Art Experience.\nCome as you are. Get messy. Follow your intuiti
 on. See what happens when you let go.\nOctober 10 & 24 • 10 AM–1 PM18+
  • $45 • Limited to 15 participantsMare Island Art Studios\, 110 Pinta
 do St.\, Vallejo\n\n$45.00\n\nTickets: https://thelettinggoartexperience.c
 om/all-events/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/step-deep-dive-workshop/\
 nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/step-i
 nto-wonder-deep-dive-fb-banner.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Mare Island Art Studios\, 110 Pintado St. Vallejo
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/step-deep-dive-workshop/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Outdoor Painting Gathering at the Palace of Fine Arts
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T120000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639103@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:© Out There WatercolorsFree outdoor painting gathering at the
  Palace of Fine Arts.\nCome paint with us. Sign up at Painters Unite to he
 ar about future gatherings.\nPainters Unite is a free gathering for anyone
  who wants to slow down and paint outdoors\, together. No class\, no press
 ure\, nothing for sale.\nI’m Marco Flavio\, a watercolor teacher here in
  the city. I started this because so many people told me they wanted more 
 time to paint and to be around others\, and I think that shouldn’t have 
 to cost anything. I’ll be painting right alongside you\, same as everyon
 e.\n\nThis time we’re meeting at the Palace of Fine Arts\, at the inters
 ection of Baker Street and Beach Street at 10AM. From there we’ll have a
  beautiful view across the lagoon toward the Palace\, with the architectur
 e\, water\, and reflections all in front of us. It’s a great opportunity
  to play with reflections in watercolor and simplify a pretty spectacular 
 scene into a painting.\nAs always\, I’ll bring a few small challenges\, 
 different ways of seeing and painting what’s in front of us. I’ll also
  have a limited number of pre-drawings of the Palace of Fine Arts on water
 color paper\, first come\, first served\, for beginners who’d like a sta
 rting point. Take a challenge\, use a pre-draw\, or simply find a spot and
  paint. No experience needed.\nBring a sketchbook and something to draw or
  paint with. If you have a watercolor kit\, bring it. A folding or camping
  chair is welcome\, or a mat or blanket to sit on. Anything that makes it 
 comfo...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.outtherewatercolors.com/painters-
 unite\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-outdoor-painting-gathering-pa
 lace-fine-arts-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_88
 85.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Palace of Fine Arts\, 3301 Lyon Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94123
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-outdoor-painting-gathering-palace-fine-ar
 ts-sf/
END:VEVENT
