DESCRIPTION:Rang De Bollywood By ManpreetExperience a vibrant\, free Bolly
 wood Garba dance event in Union Square\, San Francisco. Open to all ages a
 nd skill levels\, the event features multiple beginner-friendly dance less
 ons followed by an open dance party. Attendees are encouraged to come as t
 hey are or dress in colorful attire. The event welcomes newcomers and adva
 nced dancers alike\, offering a celebration of culture\, community\, and m
 usic in the heart of the city.\nOriginal Event Description:\n_Bollywood Ga
 rba at Union Square – Free & Open to All! All ages Saturday\, October 10
  · 11:00am–2:00 p.m. Union Square\, San Francisco🎉 Bollywood Garba a
 t Union Square – Free & Open to All!🪔 Saturday\, October 10th · 11:0
 0 a.m – 2:00 p.m.Come casual or dressed. No pressure. Beginner friendly.
  Walks ins and people who never done Garba more than welcome. We will do m
