SUMMARY:Mission Street: CMC + Follow the Music at Yerba Buena Gardens Fest
 ival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T160000
DTSTAMP:20261007T133325Z
UID:caldiscovery-festival-15f2d0825be6725d@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:festival
DESCRIPTION:Join CMC and our partners at Follow the Music for a celebratio
 n of talented emerging young artists from the Bay at Yerba Buena Gardens F
 estival this October. Mamboleo—featuring CMC students/alumni will bring 
 the Latin jazz heat alongside some other incredible groups.\nPerformers:\n
 Mamboleo (CMC)\nOakland Rising (Follow the Music\, OSA)\nMiles Turk & Frie
 nds (SFJazz\, Glide)\nOxymora (Blue Bear School of Music)\nELM Youth Orche
 stra\nOSA Vocal Ensemble\nSince launching in 2023 Follow the Music has bee
 n at the forefront of a rising movement promoting arts education around th
 e Bay Area. The nonprofit organization introduces its next phase with an e
 merging artists music festival designed to showcase aspiring young musicia
 ns. Bringing families and young people from all over the region to the urb
 an oasis of the Gardens\, Follow the Music celebrates the Bay Area’s unr
 ivaled cultural heritage by building a bridge between that legacy and the 
 young people carrying it forward. Featuring musicians ages 14-25\, the eve
 nt includes musicians from the San Francisco Community Music Center\, Oakl
 and School for the Arts\, SFJAZZ\, GLIDE Memorial Church\, Blue Bear Schoo
 l of Music\, Elevate Oakland\, Enriching Lives Through Music and other org
 anizations. Drawing on the Bay Area’s cultural diversity\, the lineup cr
 osses genres from classical and jazz to soul\, rock and Latin jazz. It als
 o features guest speakers from music\, sports and popular culture. A commu
 nity resource fair provides families and students with oppo...\n\nPublishe
 d by Mission Local\nContains information from CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.c
 om)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://missionlocal.org/event/mission-street-c
 mc-follow-the-music-at-yerba-buena-gardens-festival/?utm_source=caldiscove
 ry&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T133325Z
LOCATION:Mission Street\, Mission St.\, San Francisco\, CA\, United States
