DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerTommy Netzband - Haunted Haigh
 t Walking ToursGo Ghost Hunting This Halloween with Haunted Haight®\nCuri
 ous about ghost hunting? Spend an evening in Haight-Ashbury with Tommy Net
 zband\, founder of the San Francisco Ghost Society and a paranormal invest
 igator with more than 20 years of experience. You may have seen him on the
  History Channel or Travel Channel. Now you can join him for a ghost hunti
 ng adventure of your own.\n\nDuring this two-hour walk\, Tommy shares stor
 ies from his team’s real investigations that you won’t hear on any oth
 er tour. Try custom-built ghost hunting equipment\, learn how investigator
 s approach unexplained activity\, and ask the questions you’ve always wa
 nted to ask.\nSkeptics are always welcome!\nTommy is also the author of Ha
 unted Haight®: Ghost and True Crime Tales from Haight-Ashbury and Beyond.
  If you’ve read the book\, now you can walk with the spirits and visit t
 he places behind the stories.\nThings can get spooky\, but there’s plent
 y of fun along the way\, including chances to win prizes. With only 14 gue
 sts per tour\, everyone has time to ask questions and get involved.\nYour 
 ticket helps fund real paranormal research and free investigations through
  the San Francisco Ghost Society. Learn more at SFGhostSociety.org.\nAdvan
 ce reservations are necessary. Only 14 spots per tour.\nRecommended for ag
 es 13 and older. Bring a warm jacket\, comfortable walking shoes\, and you
 r curiosity. Tours run rain or shine.\nReserve your ghost huntin...\n\n$29
 .00\n\nTickets: https://www.hauntedhaight.com\nDetails: https://sf.funchea
 p.com/halloween-ghost-hunt-haunted-haight-walking-tour-haightashbury/\nSou
