 nk Theatre\n\n24-hour notice is required for cancelations. Late cancelatio
 ns may be transferred to another show date of your choosing. Seating is fi
 rst come\, first serve. Parties later than 15-20 minutes may have their ti
 ckets sold at the door.\n\n2026 San Francisco Drunk Theatre Schedule\nOcto
 ber 2026 shows\n\nSaturday\, October 3\, 2026 | 9:30pm – 11:00pm – Get
  Tickets\nSa...\n\n$23.18\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/drunk-t
 heatres-nightmare-on-valencia-st-halloween-special-tickets-1999538336992?d
 iscount=FUNCHEAP&amp\;aff=FuncheapSponsoredTopPick\nDetails: https://sf.fu
 ncheap.com/sf-drunk-theatre-halloween-special-nightmare-on-valencia-st-oct
 -10/\nSource: Funcheap SF
