DESCRIPTION:Gratta WinesThe 7th Annual Butchertown Jazz Festival is a free
 \, family-friendly event at Gratta Wines in San Francisco’s Bayview\, fe
 aturing live jazz and soul performances\, local food and wine\, artists\, 
 makers\, and community organizations. Attendees can enjoy a vibrant outdoo
 r neighborhood celebration that highlights the creativity and culture of t
 he Bayview district. The festival includes musical performances\, food and
  beverage vendors\, and local art\, offering a welcoming atmosphere for bo
 th residents and visitors.\nOriginal Event Description:\n_The 7th Annual B
 utchertown Jazz Festival — a free celebration of music\, food\, wine\, a
 rt\, and community in San Francisco’s Bayview.7th Annual Butchertown Jaz
 z FestivalOn Sunday\, October 11\, 2026\, Gratta Wines invites you to spen
 d the day with us for one of the neighborhood’s most beloved community g
 atherings.The Butchertown Jazz Festival brings together live jazz and soul
  music\, local food and wine\, artists\, makers\, small businesses\, and c
 ommunity organizations for a day that celebrates the creativity\, culture\
 , and spirit of the Bayview.At its heart\, this festival is about bringing
  people together. Whether you’re a longtime Bayview resident\, visiting 
 from another part of San Francisco\, or discovering the neighborhood for t
 he first time\, you’re invited to come enjoy the music\, support local b
 usinesses\, connect with community\, and experience what makes Butchertown
  special.What to ExpectLive jazz and musical performancesLocal food and be
 ve...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/7th-annual-butchert
 own-jazz-festival-tickets-1999122691786\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/
 sfs-free-outdoor-butchertown-jazz-festival-2026-bayview/\nSource: Funcheap
  SF
