 dly • All Ages Welcome**\n🍻 **WILLKOMMEN! — WELCOME!**\nCome spend 
 your Sunday celebrating Oktoberfest in beautiful **Historic Crockett** wit
 h live music\, Bavarian entertainment\, great food\, beer & wine\, an **OP
 EN CAR SHOW**\, axe throwing\, contests\, vendors\, dancing and plenty of 
 family fun!\n🚗🔥 **FREE OPEN CAR SHOW — BRING YOUR CAR & SHOW IT OF
 F!**\n**This is NOT just a classic car show!**\nGot a car you’re proud o
 f? **Bring it!**\n🚘 Classics • 🏎️ Sports Cars • 🔥 Muscle Ca
 rs • 🛞 Customs • ✨ Lowriders • 🏁 Imports • 🚗 Vintage & 
