 y**\n🍻 **O’ZAPFT IS! — IT’S TAPPED!**\n🇩🇪 **12:30 PM – 1:
 00 PM — Bavarian Dancers**\n🏆 **1:00 PM – 1:45 PM — Oktoberfest G
 ames & Contests**\n🎟️ Raffle — Win awesome Oktoberfest prizes!\n
 🍺 Stein Holding Contest\n🎤 Yodeling Contest\n🪗🔥 **2:15 PM – 
 5:00 PM — HEADLINER: ANDRE THIERRY!**\n🎶 **ZYDECO • BLUES • ROCK 
 • ACCORDION SOUL & MUCH MORE!**\nAndre Thierry and his b...\n\nPublished
  by San Francisco Bay Area Moms\nContains information from CalDiscovery (c
 aldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://sanfranciscomoms.com/event
