DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Italian Heritage Day with the Museo!\n\nJoin us as t
 he Museo takes part in the Italian Heritage Day Parade!\nLook for us ridin
 g along in a historic 1931 Ford AA Truck as we celebrate Italian heritage\
 , culture\, and community together.\n\nWant to join us on the truck? Space
