DESCRIPTION:Don't miss this extraordinary conversation with Academy Award-
 winning actor and producer Michael Douglas celebrating the release of his 
 new memoir\, One Helluva Ride. A signed bookplate edition of the book is i
 ncluded with each ticket.\nBeginning with his fractured childhood and a co
 mplex relationship with his superstar father\, Kirk Douglas\, Michael Doug
 las finally gives the full and uncensored account of a remarkable life. On
 e Helluva Ride reveals incredible behind-the-scenes stories featuring a Wh
 o’s Who of Hollywood\, many of them never revealed before and some outra
 geously funny\, with an unflinching honesty about his sometimes bad-boy li
 fe.\nMichael will be joined in conversation by Lance Gardner the executive
  artistic director at Marin Theatre Company in Mill Valley.\n\nBook Passag
 e Presents:\n\nTickets: https://bookpassage.com/event/michael-douglas-one-
 helluva-ride-calvary-presbyterian-sf\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/10/11/michael-douglas-with-lance-gardner-one-helluva-ride-calvary-pr
 esbyterian-sf-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.f
 uncheap.com/actor-michael-douglas-conversation-memoir-helluva-ride-sf/
