LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Alamo Drafthouse Cinema\, 2550 Mission St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/11/repo-the-genetic-opera-tickets
END:VEVENT
