BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Alcatraz’s Sunrise Gathering for Indigenous Peoples’ Day (2026
 )
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T041500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T080000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-382389@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:History
DESCRIPTION:Indigenous Peoples’ Day Sunrise Gathering at Alcatraz (2026)
 \nAlison Taggart-Barone via NPS\n\nThe Indigenous Peoples’ Day Sunrise G
 athering on October 12 and November 26\, 2026 are organized by the Interna
 tional Indian Treaty Council commemorating the 1969-71 occupation of Alcat
 raz by the Indians of All Tribes.\nThese are one-day events and not the st
 andard Alcatraz Island tour\; all areas except where the ceremony takes pl
 ace will be closed and inaccessible to the public.\nThe event is technical
 ly free\, but requires a $12 round trip boat trip to the island (kids 5 an
 d under are free)\n\nIncludes\n\nCommemoration of the 1969-71 occupation o
 f Alcatraz by the Indians of All Tribes\n\nSchedule\n\nOctober 12\, 2026: 
 Indigenous People’s Day\nDeparture Times: 4:15 am\, 4:30 am\, 5:00 am\, 
 5:15 am\nNovember 26\, 2026: Thanksgiving\n\nDeparture Times: 4:15 am\, 4:
 30 am\, 4:45 am\, 5:00 am\, 5:15 am\, 5:30 am\, 5:45am\, 6:00 am\n\nDress 
 Code\n\nThe weather on Alcatraz is unpredictable and subject to change une
 xpectedly\, so be sure to dress in layers…bring along a light jacket or 
 sweater\, no matter how nice the day begins! Follow this link for more inf
 ormation.\n\nWhere to Meet\n\nPier 33 Alcatraz Landing\nPier 33 Alcatraz L
 anding is the launch site to Alcatraz Island.\nAlcatraz Landing includes t
 he Ticketbooth and waiting and boarding areas\, all of which are accessibl
 e. Accessible bathrooms are found at Pier 33 Alcatraz Landing and on all A
 lcatraz Cruises vessels.\nPlease note: there are no wheelchairs available 
 for loan eit...\n\n$12.00\n\nTickets: https://alcatrazcitycruises.com/tick
 ets/sunrise-gathering-ceremony\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sunrise-g
 athering-alcatraz-indigenous-peoples-day/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/120326
 97_10153718938301554_6215023982069084485_o1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Alcatraz Island\, San Francisco\, CA 94133
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sunrise-gathering-alcatraz-indigenous-peoples-
 day/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SF’s Giant “R-Evolution” Sculpture Final Day / Tear Down (Em
 barcadero Plaza)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1640355@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:SF’s Giant “R-Evolution” Sculpture Farewell Party + DJ P
 arty (Embarcadero Plaza)\nBig Art Loop\n\nAfter a year and a half\, Celebr
 ate Marco Cochrane’s 45-ft “R-Evolution” naked sculpture with live p
 erformances\, music & a dance party at Embarcadero Plaza on October 2\, 20
 26 from 05:30 PM – 08:00 PM\n\nA Final Celebration at Marco Cochrane’s
  R-Evolution\, presented by Big Art Loop\nAfter gracing San Francisco’s 
 waterfront with her strength\, beauty\, and monumental presence\, Marco Co
 chrane’s breathtaking 32\,000 pound sculpture\, R-Evolution\, is prepari
 ng to leave Embarcadero Plaza.\n\nJoin Big Art Loop\, Building 180\, Opule
 nt Temple\, and San Francisco Recreation and Parks Department for an unfor
 gettable final celebration honoring the sculpture\, the story behind her c
 reation\, and the impact she has made during her time in San Francisco.\nR
 -Evolution will start to come down Monday\, October 12th\, 2026 and will b
 e completely off site by Thursday\, October 15th\, 2026\, so please join B
 ig Art Loop to dance the departure away.\nThe evening will be filled with 
 a word from the artist\, live music\, inspiring performances\, a global me
 ditation\, and a closing DJ set by Opulent Temple.\nAll are welcome to gat
 her beneath R-Evolution one last time to celebrate\, reflect\, dance\, and
  say goodbye. You won’t want to miss this powerful farewell. The celebra
 tion is free\, with RSVPs encouraged.\n\nOctober 2\, 2026 Celebration\n05:
 30 PM – 08:00 PM\nLive music // DJs // Performances\n\nOpulent Temple\n\
 nJoin us for an afternoon of l...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagra
 m.com/p/DchEKSGAZCK/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp\;igsi=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ=
 =\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-giant-r-evolution-sculpture-final-
 day-tear-down-embarcadero-plaza/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/785234
 014_17901376989559092_754495610316279123_n.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Embarcadero Plaza\, 1 Market Street\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-giant-r-evolution-sculpture-final-day-tear
 -down-embarcadero-plaza/
END:VEVENT
