 cial dancing\; dancing is included with lesson admission.\n11:30 PM — Ev
 ent ends.\nTICKETS\nEarly-bird dancing only\, after 9 PM: $10.\nLessons an
 d dancing\, starting at 7 PM: $40.\nDancing only at the door\, after 9 PM:
