 lusions:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/2000361107922\nTickets are for Octo
 ber 12 only. All sales are final\; no refunds or exchanges.\nAges 21+ with
  valid ID. Full bar and free parking\, as listed on Eventbrite. Wear comfo
 rtable clothes that let you move\; smooth-soled shoes are ideal. Clement S
 treet has plenty of restaurants and cafés\, so come early and make an eve
 ning of it.\nPresented by Dance Fridays\, Saturdays\, Mondays and More / S
 alsaCrazy.\nQuestions...\n\n$10.00\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/
