UID:caldiscovery-festival-66d6166406fc610d@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:festival,free
DESCRIPTION:The Block Party is a UCSF tradition. Imagine a mid-day festiva
 l with all your best friends at work\, music\, art\, games\, and prizes.\n
 \nBlock Party 14 is happening on October 14\, 11 a.m. - 1:30 p.m. at Gene 
 Friend Way\, Mission Bay campus\n\nCome for:\n\n🌯 Lunch! The first 2\,2
 00 guests who check in with their UCSF ID get a $13 in Pride Bucks to buy 
 lunch at participating on-campus retailers🎲 Drag bingo🎳 Games🐶 Fu
 rry friends🎁 Giveaways*Sponsored by Golden 1 Credit Union.\n\nAs always
 :\n\nOur events are always free to attend.\n\nUCSF Badges are required.\n\
 nWhile supplies last.\n\nReasonable accommodation: UCSF welcomes all parti
 cipants to our events. If you need a reasonable accommodation to participa
 te in this event because of a disability\, please contact us as soon as po
 ssible: artsandevents@ucsf.edu.\n\nEvent photography/videography: We often
  take pictures at our events to commemorate the fun and to help us promote
  upcoming events. Images and videos include usage for UCSF websites\, UCSF
  social media\, and UCSF-produced digital and print marketing collateral. 
 Please let us know if you prefer not to be photographed at check-in.\n\nPu
 blished by UCSF Events Calendar Calendar\nContains information from CalDis
 covery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://calendar.ucsf.edu
 /event/block-party-14?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=
 san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T002614Z
LOCATION:Gene Friend Way Plaza (Mission Bay)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://calendar.ucsf.edu/event/block-party-14?utm_source=caldiscovery
 &utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
END:VEVENT
