CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerFree Admission Day at Yerba Bu
 ena Center for the Arts (YBCA)\nYerba Buena Center for the Arts\nOpened to
  the public in 1993\, YBCA was founded as the cultural anchor of San Franc
 isco’s Yerba Buena Gardens neighborhood. Our work spans the realms of co
 ntemporary art\, performance\, film\, civic engagement\, and public life. 
 Centering artists as essential to social and cultural movement\, YBCA is r
 eimagining the role an arts institution can play in the community it serve
 s.\nYBCA is located in the heart of San Francisco’s SOMA neighborhood\, 
 across the street from SFMOMA and the Moscone Convention Center. The main 
 entrance to our galleries and forum event space is at 701 Mission Street. 
 The main entrance to our theater is 700 Howard Street.\n\nYBCA is open Wed
 nesday–Sunday\, 11–5pm.\nEntry to YBCA Galleries is free every Wednesd
 ay\nTicketing\nGalleries\nMembers: Free\nAdult (18+): $10\nStudents & Seni
 ors: $5\nYouth (17 and under)\, Military Personnel\, & Museums for All: Fr
 ee\nWednesdays: Free\nEmployees of other museums with current valid staff 
 ID receive free general admission for themselves and one guest.\nMuseums f
 or All\nYBCA offers free admission for Medi-Cal and EBT card holders as pa
 rt of the Museums for All program. Benefits card required upon entry. Tick
 ets must be purchased at the ticketing desk at YBCA.\nHours\nGalleries\nWe
 d–Sun: 11 AM–5 PM\nMon–Tues: Closed\n\nUpcoming Free Admission Day a
 t Yerba Buena Center for the Arts (YBCA) Events\nWed 10/7 Free Admission D
 ay at...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.ybca.org/visit-us\nDetails: https
 ://sf.funcheap.com/free-admission-day-at-yerba-buena-center-for-the-arts-y
 bca-157/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ybca-b
 uilding.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Yerba Buena Center for the Arts\, 701 Mission Street San Francisc
 o\, CA 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-admission-day-at-yerba-buena-center-for-t
 he-arts-ybca-157/
END:VEVENT
