UID:funcheap-1641029@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Community
DESCRIPTION:Made in Canva\nDon’t let that list of to-dos keep piling up\
 ; get stuff done in the company of others at admin night. Invite a friend 
 or meet someone new and we’ll motivate each other to accomplish those sm
 all or big chores we’ve been putting off. Bring a phone or laptop and or
 ganize your inbox\, pay bills\, clean your calendar\, plan that trip\, or 
 delete those unattractive selfies. Get a new library card or renew your ac
 count and learn about library resources.\nLight snacks and drinks offered 
 at admin nights in the library and drinks and food available for purchase 
 at partner locations. Meets the second Wednesday of the month at various l
 ocations. Register for email reminders or visit on.sfpl.org/admin for the 
 latest updates.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfpl.org/events/2026/10/14/act
