 p of vintage political memorabilia of and by offbeat San Francisco players
  will open at Pier 23 Cafe Waterfront Gallery\, Friday\, October 16\, 2026
 \, from 4-6 pm.\nArt include posters by Spain Rodriguez\, S. Clay Wilson\,
  Victor Moscoso\, Lil’ Tuffy\, and the “Picasso of the Tenderloin.”\
 nExhibit collected by Penny deVries in memory of the former District Attor
 ney of San Francisco and civil rights activist Terence Hallinan.\n\nDJ Kan
 traban Kartel will provide music 4-7 pm.\nExhibit up Oct 16 through Nov 9\
 , 2026\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.pier23cafe.com\nDetails: https://sf
