BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:San Franpsycho & Dirtybird Present: 25 Years Of Psycho Closing Par
 ty
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17925899@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to dance all night and celebrate 25 wild years of ps
 ycho vibes with San Franpsycho and Dirtybird!\n\nThis is your last chance 
 to dive into 25 wild years of Psycho with San Franpsycho's epic retrospect
 ive\, live and in person. Before the show comes down for good\, two homegr
 own SF institutions are joining forces to throw one hell of a send-off.\nS
 ome brands make clothes. SFP made a culture out of Ocean Beach\, a striped
  van\, and a city that claimed it as its own. "Quarter Century of Psycho: 
 A San Franpsycho Retrospective" puts 25 years of that story in one room. I
 t brings together work from local artists\, original shirts\, art\, poster
 s\, archival footage\, collabs\, and real stories from the people whose li
 ves SFP touched along the way. It's a look back\, and a nod to everything 
 it took to get here.\nThe centerpiece of the night is a screening of the s
 econd San Franpsycho surf film\, "Wet and Wreckless\," which hasn't been s
 een publicly in over two decades.\nThen\, the flock takes over. Dirtybird 
 has been dropping basslines and spreading good times from San Francisco to
  dancefloors around the world since it started with parties in Golden Gate
  Park. For the closing night\, two Dirtybird DJs will take the decks\, and
  their names are staying under wraps until closer to the party. Follow @sa
 nfranpsycho and @dirtybird so you're first to know when the lineup drops. 
 Expect bass-heavy\, booty-shaking house\, plenty of mischief\, and a room 
 full of the people who made both brands what they are.\nI...\n\n21+\nDirty
 bird & San Franpsycho: 25 Years Of Psycho Closing Party\n\nTickets: https:
 //consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fsan-fran
 psycho-x-dirtybird-present-25-years-of-psycho-closing-party-tickets-200194
 0045567%3Fkeep_tld%3Dtrue\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/16
 /san-franpsycho-dirtybird-present-25-years-of-psycho-closing-party-tickets
 \nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7873057;-122.3993712
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34814640/ba1f869c-fc8f-45c6-ac2e-0b48e359ca52.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:111 Minna Gallery\, 111 Minna St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/16/san-franpsycho-dirtybird-presen
 t-25-years-of-psycho-closing-party-tickets
