CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSan Francisco Chamber Orchestr
 aBetrayed by Napoleon’s thirst for power\, Beethoven furiously tore apar
 t his 3rd Symphony’s dedication\, and in doing so created a work that ca
 ptured\, like no other\, the defiant and life-affirming heroic spirit. Wit
 h its massive size and emotional power\, the Eroica Symphony would change 
 the course of Classical music forever.\nOur program begins with the Coriol
 an Overture\, Beethoven’s electrifying portrait of Shakespeare’s doome
 d warrior followed by Grace William’s hauntingly beautiful Sea Sketches\
 , which paint the Welsh coastline in all its wild\, shimmering glory.\n\nP
 rogram:\nLudwig van Beethoven – Coriolan Overture\, Op. 62\nGrace Willia
 ms – Sea Sketches\nLudwig van Beethoven – Symphony No. 3 in Eb Major\,
  Op. 55 “Eroica”\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/main
 stage-1-beethovens-eroica-a-heros-journey-tickets-1991879006729?aff=oddtdt
 creator&amp\;keep_tld=true\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/mainstage-1-b
 eethovens-eroica-heros-journey-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
