 y)\nFine Arts Museums of San Francisco\nEvery Saturday\, the de Young offe
 rs free general admission to the permanent galleries to Bay Area residents
 . Please note that admission to any special exhibits is not included nor d
 iscounted and will require the full admission price.\nSaturdays feature en
 gaging art experiences for the entire family\, including art-making\, gall
 ery guides\, and tours with discussion and sketching in the permanent gall
 eries.\n\nFree Saturdays for Bay Area Residents\nde Young Museum\nGolden G
 ate Park \\ 50 Hagiwara Tea Garden Drive\, San Francisco\, CA 94118\n– M
 ost Saturdays\n– Timed ticket reservations typically from 9:30a to 4:30p
 \nReserve tickets in advance to skip the line – timed tickets required. 
 Limited in person tickets might be available at the membership desk\n\nThi
 s offer applies only to general admission for the permanent collection gal
 leries.\nFull-priced admission to special exhibitions still applies.\nFor:
  Residents of Alameda\, Contra Costa\, Marin\, Napa\, San Francisco\, San 
 Mateo\, Santa Clara\, Solano\, and Sonoma Counties with valid photo ID or 
 postmarked envelope bearing home address\n\nVisitors ages 17 and under alw
 ays receive free admission to the permanent collection galleries.\nPlease 
 note this free Saturdays offer could be changed or canceled at anytime. Vi
 sit deyoung.famsf.org for updates before attending.\n\nUpcoming Free de Yo
 ung Museum Day for Bay Area Residents (Every Saturday) Events\nSat 10/10..
