DESCRIPTION:A fragile\, anxious boy\, 12-year-old Oskar is regularly bulli
 ed by his stronger classmates but never strikes back. The lonely boy's wis
 h for a friend seems to come true when he meets Eli\, also 12\, who moves 
 in next door to him with her father. A pale\, serious young girl\, she onl
 y comes out at night and doesn't seem affected by the freezing temperature
 s.\n\nPlaying as part of the International Vampire Film Fest at the Balboa
  on Saturday\, October 17. Individual tickets and $30 day passes on sale n
 ow.\n\n$30\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/19828?s
 iteToken=52wkfzmjpwjjfpz3ye7tz8wscg\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/
