DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T172218Z
UID:dothebay-17729435@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:See Nagisa Ōshima’s “The Ceremony” (1971) a film that e
 xplores the politics of desire through the story of a Japanese family forc
 ed to submit to a series of cruelly enforced traditions. Enjoy themed snac
 ks as part of this series inspired by GaHee Park’s exhibition “Behind 
 the Curtain.” Free gallery admission included with your ticket!\n\n“Th
