SUMMARY:Brain Brew Ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T150000
DTSTAMP:20261006T172218Z
UID:funcheap-1640829@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Free Food
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBrain BrewBrain Brew is a yout
 h-led brain health initiative bringing a free\, interactive Community Day 
 to San Francisco. Visitors can take part in Brain Olympics\, hands-on neur
 oscience activities\, the Community Memory Wall\, brain-health demonstrati
 ons\, prizes\, food and cold brew\, and more.\nThe Community Day is part o
 f Brain Brew’s three-event brain health campaign across San Francisco. O
 n October 17\, the team will cycle a 22.4-mile route tracing the shape of 
 a human brain through the city\, followed by the free Community Day on Oct
 ober 18. On October 24\, the Brain Brew Crew will join the Walk to End Alz
 heimer’s San Francisco.\n\nCome for 20 minutes or stay for the afternoon
 . Admission is completely free.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://brainbrewsf.or
 g/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/brain-brew-ride-sf/\nSource: Funcheap
  SF
