 ks\, zines\, artist books and independent publishing represented.\nSaturda
 y\, October 17\, 11am-5pm\n& Sunday\, October 18\, 11am-5pm\, 2026\nThe Sa
 n Francisco Photobook Fair will host over 30 tables of publishers and vend
 ors selling and promoting photography books\, magazines\, and zine publica
 tions during a two-day weekend event hosted at the Harvey Milk Photo Cente
 r.\n\nThe fair will take place October 17th and 18th 2026 and will be open
