 ets for ages 15 and under are $25)Link: http://siliconvalleyopen.comGet up
  close and personal with the world’s top squash professionals and experi
 ence the excitement of world-class squash at the FREE Silicon Valley Open 
 FanFest\, presented by Crowd Street!The official community kickoff to the 
 2026 Silicon Valley Open (October 20–24)\, FanFest gives fans a unique o
 pportunity to meet the players\, and even play alongside them in fun\, fam
 ily-friendly games of ping pong\, Jenga and cornhole.Meet top-ranked Ameri
 can and international squash stars and LA28 Olympic hopefuls\, get autogra
 phs\, snap photos and take home a FREE commemorative Silicon Valley Open p
 oster. Fans can also enjoy complimentary Randy’s donuts before watching 
 the pros take to the glass court for the evening’s tournament action.Wit
 h squash set to make its Olympic debut at the LA28 Games\, FanFest is a ra
 re opportunity for Bay Area fans of all ages to meet and play with some of
  the athletes who could soon compete on the world’s biggest sporting sta
 ge.\n\nPublished by KGO\nContains information from CalDiscovery (caldiscov
 ery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: http://siliconvalleyopen.com?utm_source=ca
