 ent and has graced the covers of leading publications including ELLEMEN Fr
 esh\, GQ Thailand\, Esquire Singapore\, Harper’s Bazaar Men\, Flaunt\, a
 nd more.\n\nHis discography includes his debut mini album TEN\, his second
