 k “STUNNER” became the most-listened-to song on the Spotify Thailand c
 hart in 2025\, earned multiple wins on Korean music programs such as Music
  Bank\, The Show\, and Inkigayo Hot Stage\, and was named Spotify Thailand
 ’s Top Song of the Year in 2025. He also received the Best Choice Award 
 at the 2024 Asia Artist Awards. His accumulated music streams exceed 460 m
 illion\, with his music videos surpassing 35 million views. Lifetime strea
