 edia at the end of 2019. Almost immediately she began garnering heavy buzz
  from both early adopter fans and industry professionals alike. In just ov
 er a year\, WOLF has accumulated over 40 million streams and has developed
  a passionate and rabid fan base -- all out of her bedroom in Queens\, NY.
