DESCRIPTION:Take control of your finances today! Join us for a full day of
  expert advice on managing your finances and planning for the future. Get 
 free\, objective\, no-strings-attached one-on-one counseling from CERTIFIE
 D FINANCIAL PLANNER(TM) professionals and attend financial workshops throu
 ghout the day. All financial workshops will take place in the Koret Audito
 rium. Select workshops will also be livestreamed on Zoom.\n\nThis is a hyb
 rid event. Registration is required for Zoom attendance. In-person attenda
 nce does not require registration\; seats available first come\, first ser
 ved.\n\nTopics include investing\, income tax updates\, property tax and i
 ntergenerational transfers\, resources to strengthen your financial skills
  and an empowering approach to budgeting.\n\nOne-on-one counseling is avai
 lable in person at the Latino/Hispanic Meeting Room\, Main Library.\n\nFre
 e\n\nPresented by San Francisco Public Library\n\nFree\nSan Francisco Publ
 ic Library\n\nTickets: https://on.sfpl.org/Financial-Planning-Day26\nDetai
 ls: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/financial-planning-day-tickets\
 nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/financial-
 planning-day-sf-main-library-3/
