DESCRIPTION:Andres AmadorJoin us for a free\, drop-in community art event 
 on the beach! Once a month\, weather and tides permitting\, we come togeth
 er to create an enormous\, temporary sand painting. No experience necessar
 y\, just bring your enthusiasm. I’ll provide the tools and you bring the
  creativity. All ages and skill levels are welcome\, whether you’re a se
 asoned artist or trying something new. There’s a short orientation to se
 t the day’s theme\, but no formal instruction\, just jumping right into 
 the collective canvas. Bring family and friends for an afternoon of connec
 tion and monumental collaborative art. See you at the beach!\n\nFree\n\nTi
 ckets: https://www.andresamadorarts.com/events\nDetails: https://sf.funche
 ap.com/free-giant-sand-painting-community-art-beach-ocean-beach/\nSource: 
