DESCRIPTION:“Crazy Funny Asians” Free Comedy Showcase (SF)\nHellaFunny
 \nInspired by the blockbuster movie\, see some of the Bay Area’s top com
 edians at San Francisco’s Crazy Funny Asians comedy showcase\, presented
  by Funcheap and HellaFunny. Let’s celebrate the Bay’s Asian-American 
 culture and heritage with laughs at SF’s brand new comedy club on Market
  St – The Function.\nFree tickets for the first 100 people to RSVP\n“C
 razy Funny Asians” Comedy Showcase\nEvery Friday & Saturday at 7pm + 9pm
 \nThe Function Comedy Club\, 1414 Market St.\, SF\nFREE with RSVP (Donatio
 ns appreciated – bring cash) – limited to first 50\nDidn’t Get Ticke
 ts? We’ll have 20 door tickets ($25) available for each show – Show up
  early to snag them!\nTickets\n– FREE with Eventbrite RSVP – Donations
  appreciated – bring cash\n– Maximum Two Comp Tickets Per Person – I
 f you have additional guests you’d like to bring\, they must RSVP separa
 tely\n– $25 door (without RSVP)\n– Lineup subject to change\n– Admis
 sion is first come first served\n– Like most comedy clubs\, there is a t
 wo-drink minimum to help support our local bar scene.\nHosted by K. Cheng 
 (NBC’s Stand Up for Diversity\, Khmers of Comedy\, Host SF Chinese New Y
 ear Parade Pre-Show)\nCrazy Funny Asians Comedy Lineup\nEvery week is a ne
 w lineup. Here are some of our favorites you might see…\n\nJeen Yee-Tomm
 y Ts\nChris Posadas-Tommy Ts\nShawn Felipe-WorldAsia TV\, Sprint Comedy\nN
 icole Tran- Tommy T’s\nRyan Chan- Opened for Earthquake\nMoon Choe- SF S
 ketchfest\nAndrew Orofolo-SF Punchline\nPlus many...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: h
 ttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/crazy-funny-asians-live-comedy-show-tickets-16
 2483976949?aff=FCWebsite\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/crazy-funny-asi
 ans-free-comedy-showcase-sf-101/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/CrazyF
 unnyAsians-e1535334557269.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:The Function\, 1414 Market Street\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/crazy-funny-asians-free-comedy-showcase-sf-101
 /
END:VEVENT
