BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jai Wolf
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17524331@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:After the success of indie-dance anthems like “Indian Summer
 ” and “Starlight\,” blockbuster festival sets from Indio to India\, 
 and co-signs from the likes of Skrillex and ODESZA\, it’s clear from the
  opening notes of Jai Wolf’s long-awaited debut album The Cure to Loneli
 ness that he sees the expectations around his name as an opportunity to ch
 allenge convention.\n\nThe Cure to Loneliness finds Jai Wolf completing hi
 s evolution from upstart bedroom remixer to future bass DJ to builder of l
 ush musical worlds. While still very much dancefloor-focused\, some tracks
  on the LP conjure the angular riffage of The Strokes and Phoenix\, weave 
 melodies through the sugary happysad of M83 and CHVRCHES\, or build up wal
 ls of sound like Explosions in the Sky—all while maintaining the melodio
 us polish and evocative groove to which fans have grown so close.\n\n“In
  my heart\, this album is me\,” says Jai Wolf. “From the sounds to the
  lyrics\, it’s everything that I’ve always wanted to do.” Taking a d
 ifferent approach to many of his contemporaries\, Jai Wolf largely eschewe
 d singles over the course of two years to patiently craft The Cure to Lone
 liness. The result is a thoughtfully framed\, confidently expressed musica
 l vision that will tug at heartstrings in 2019 and long beyond.\n\nThe arc
  of Jai Wolf’s live performances began with DJing during his “Kindred 
 Spirits” EP era (2016-2018) and has evolved into an all encompassing aud
 io-visual live experience. With meticulous attention to detail in curating
  custom...\n\n18+\nGoldenvoice Presents\n\nTickets: https://shop.axs.com/?
 c=axs&e=30567424546472043\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24
 /jai-wolf-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7879104;-122.4215079
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32918908/5b0444e6-0f9d-404e-830f-89e600dc71f2.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Regency Ballroom\, 1290 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/jai-wolf-tickets
END:VEVENT
