  readings\, and dance and imbibe to the soundtrack of underground radio an
 d local DJs. Costumes are encouraged!\n\nThursday\, October 29 from 7-10 p
 m\nFriday\, October 30 from 5-7 pm (family-friendly show)\nFriday\, Octobe
 r 30 from 8-10 pm\nSaturday\, October 30 from 8-11 pm\n\nTickets: $25\nKid
