DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment Presents\nLady Camden Presents: T
 he Peach Pit Cabaret\nwith Willow Pill & Special Guests\n\nThursday\, Octo
 ber 29 | Bimbo's 365 Club\n\nLady Camden returns to Bimbo's 365 Club on Oc
 tober 29 for a Halloween edition of The Peach Pit Cabaret!\n\nDon't miss a
  chilling evening of drag and burlesque featuring Lady Camden and special 
 guests Willow Pill\, Hera Wynn\, Hands\, Major Hammy\, and Redbone.\n\nMer
 ging the worlds of drag\, burlesque\, lounge\, performance art\, live musi
 c\, and even circus tricks with a vintage twist straight out of Moulin Rou
 ge\, drawing from references new and old\, ranging from Cabaret\, to Chica
 go\, to Chappell Roan\, to Christina Aguilera and 2001’s “Lady Marmala
 de\,” Lady Camden invites you to step into her secret\, sexy\, glamorous
 \, speakeasy… with stunning performances\, audience interaction\, live p
 iano\, comedy\, stunts\, choreography\, burlesque performers\, drag legend
 s\, gender-bending\, and more.\n\nUpon entering The Pitch Pit Cabaret\, ex
 pect to find your seat within a speakeasy themed environment with cocktail
 s\, mood-lighting\, and twinkling piano covers. During the show\, Lady Cam
 den might just slink on over to your table and perch next to you in a feat
 hered robe while introducing the night’s next performer. Try not to be b
 linded by the beads\, rhinestones\, and bright stars on the lineup\, but d
 efinitely drop a song request into her fish-bowl if offered the chance.\n\
 nStarring the Castro's own world-renowned drag artist and producer Lady Ca
 mden\, along with...\n\n$48.93 - $116.40\, 21+\nAnother Planet Entertainme
 nt Presents\n\nTickets: https://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272
