DESCRIPTION:Monaleo\, the unapologetic force from Houston\, Texas\, has qu
 ickly become one of hip-hop’s most compelling new voices. At 24\, she’
 s captivated listeners and critics alike with her fearless lyricism\, bold
  femininity\, and undeniable charisma. Her breakout hit “Beating Down Yo
  Block” reimagined Yungstar’s 1999 Houston classic into a post-breakup
  anthem that resonated across generations\, earning RIAA Gold certificatio
 n\, over 34 million YouTube views\, and cemented her as a rising star.\n\n
 Music has always been a cornerstone for Monaleo\, whose earliest performan
 ces took place in her church choir under her grandmother’s encouragement
 . By age seven\, she taught herself to play piano\, channeling her creativ
 ity into a natural talent for melody and expression. In 2024 her viral sen
 sation “Don Who Leo” inspired more than 3.7 million\n\nTikTok creation
 s\, peaked at #16 on Tik Tok Billboard Charts. A commanding presence on st
 age\, Monaleo joined Don Toliver\, Ski Mask the Slump God\, and Molly Sant
 ana on a sold-out arena tour\, sharing her electrifying artistry with thou
 sands of fans and further solidifying her place in the cultural conversati
 on.\n\nNow with over 141 million all time YouTube views and 371.5M all-tim
 e streams\, Monaleo has firmly established herself as one of rap’s most 
 dynamic lyricists. Recognized by outlets like Rolling Stone\, Pitchfork\, 
 XXL\, Teen Vogue\, and Billboard\, her widespread acclaim reflects her rel
 atability\, creative versatility\, and unmistakable talent. With every rel
 ease\, M...\n\n21+\nLosGothsCo. & Scam and Jam Present\n\nTickets: https:/
 /tix.axs.com/BTg4EgAAAABzxg7HAgAAAABb%2fv%2f%2f%2fwD%2f%2f%2f%2f%2fC0dvbGR
 lbnZvaWNlAP%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f?cid=usaffdostuff\nDetails: https
 ://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/30/cholos-vs-vampires-tickets\nSource: DoTh
 eBay
GEO:37.7879104;-122.4215079
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/33424671/439ac1c7-5321-4c5a-ace6-01dac6cbba5b.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Regency Ballroom\, 1290 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/30/cholos-vs-vampires-tickets
