BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dance Thrill Fest VI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T173000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17839264@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Dance Thrill Fest VI is the 6th iteration of an annual dance f
 ilm festival curated by REYES Dance featuring short dance film works by ba
 y area artists exploring themes of horror\, thrill\, comedy and everything
  in between. This year’s festival features works by Ale Preciado\; Amit 
 Patel and Ishika Seth\; Clarissa Dyas\; Cauveri Suresh\; Ja’Moon Jones\;
  Jess Bozzo\; Kevin Lopez\; Kirsten Millan\; Fuchsia\; Lily Gee\; Megan Lo
 we\; and Yayoi Kambara. Churro Nomi will be hosting\, treats will be passe
 d out to enjoy during the screening and audience members are encouraged to
  come dressed in their halloween costume.\n\nRuntime\n\n0h 50m\n\nFormat\n
