BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Rocky Horror Picture Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17857051@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:In this cult classic\, sweethearts Brad (Barry Bostwick) and J
 anet (Susan Sarandon)\, stuck with a flat tire during a storm\, discover t
 he eerie mansion of Dr. Frank-N-Furter (Tim Curry)\, a mad scientist. As t
 heir innocence is lost\, Brad and Janet meet a houseful of wild characters
 \, including a rocking biker (Meat Loaf) and a creepy butler (Richard O'Br
 ien). Through elaborate dances and rock songs\, Frank-N-Furter unveils his
  latest creation: a muscular man named "Rocky."\n\nPerformed by the Bawdy 
 Caste\, a shadow cast that’s been performing Rocky Horror since 1995!\n\
