DESCRIPTION:The pinnacle of our Taxidermy Workshops—the DIY Taxidermy Ro
 oster Workshop—will definitely leave you feeling cocky about your creati
 on. In this intermediate workshop\, you’ll get to flaunt your feathers w
 ith your newfound skills and feathered friend.\n\nDo you need experience f
 or this one? It’s considered intermediate\, but don’t let that intimid
 ate you. Experience isn’t required—our expert taxidermist will be ther
 e to walk you through every step. So\, whether you want to jump into the d
 eep end with a lifeline or flex your pre-existing taxidermy skills\, this 
 workshop is for you.\n\nThe instructor\, Mr. Vassallo has over thirty-five
  years experience as a professional taxidermist and teacher. He has travel
 ed Continental North America\, Alaska\, Hawaii\, Mexico\, Europe and Afric
 a studying\, collecting and preserving wildlife.\n\n$560\, 18+ or with a G
 uardian\nPaxton Gate's\n\nTickets: https://paxtongate.com/products/taxider
 my-chicken-class\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/1/diy-taxid
 ermy-rooster-workshop-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
