BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dance Heals
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17882154@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:As part of the ongoing Raising Voices series\, Dance Heals gat
 hers eight films that meet some of life’s hardest realities and answer t
 hem with movement. Ukrainian women wield choreography as testimony. A flam
 enco master performs in clothing historically reserved for women. A double
  amputee becomes a withered tree blooming anew. Each piece is less about t
 he wound than what grows from it\, blending poetry\, cinematography\, and 
 activism in service of repair.\n\nCo-curated by laura elaine ellis and fol
 lowed by a panel discussion\, the screening is presented at Catharine Clar
 k Gallery alongside a concurrent exhibition by Los Angeles-based artist Sa
 ndow Birk\, whose work confronting history\, justice\, and war offers a co
 mpelling companion lens for these stories. A live performance by dazaun.da
 nce\, featuring Dazaun Soleyn\, Jordon E. Dabney\, and Claire Fisher-Mende
 z in their "work may we heal?" will precede the films.\n\nCome witness wha
 t movement can hold\, and what it can mend.\n\n25-45\n2026 SF Dance Film F
 estival:\n\nTickets: https://sfdancefilmfest.org/fall-festival-2026/dance-
 heals/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/4/dance-heals-tickets
 \nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.76638980000001;-122.4070398
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34611176/789f8a92-54d7-49dc-bce5-8ef2a8b73ea3.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Catharine Clark Gallery\, 248 Utah Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94105
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/4/dance-heals-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Black Hammer’s Free “Hopped Up” Trivia Night (Every Wednesda
 y)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638723@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBlack Hammer’s Free “Hoppe
 d Up” Trivia Night (Every Wednesday)\nBlack Hammer Brewing\nNo pens\, no
  paper.\nJoin us for three rounds of fast-paced gameshow-style pub trivia 
 in our taproom every Wednesday at 7PM. Free admission\, with bonus points 
 for fastest answer and a live scoreboard.\n\nHopped Up Trivia\nEvery Wedne
 sday at 7pm\nBlack Hammer Brewing\, 544 Bryant St\, SF\nFREE admission\nCh
 eck the website to make reservations and confirm the date.\nPrizes awarded
  for 1st\, 2nd and 3rd place finishers. Always cheer for fastest answer!\n
 Maximum team size is 8 people. Good natured trash-talking encouraged but n
 ot required.\nAbout Black Hammer Brewing\nBlack Hammer Brewing Company bre
 ws and serves award-winning gluten-removed beers that are indistinguishabl
 e from conventional gluten-containing brews. Our taproom\, which has been 
 described as “Cheers on LSD”\, features 16 fresh house-brewed beers on
  tap\, craft empanadas from El Sur\, frittatas (gluten free!) and quiches 
 from Nucha\, and warm soft pretzel sticks served with grain mustard from W
 illkommen\, as well many to-go options. We are dog friendly and offer indo
 or and heated outdoor seating with tons of street parking.\nGet to enjoy t
 heir award-winning beers while enjoying the night with friends!\n\nView th
 is post on Instagram\n\nA post shared by Black Hammer Brewing Company (@bl
 ackhammerbrewing)\n\nUpcoming Black Hammer’s Free “Hopped Up” Trivia
  Night (Every Wednesday) Events\nWed 10/7 Black Hammer’s Free “Hopped 
 Up” Trivia...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://bhb.beer/trivia\nDetails: http
 s://sf.funcheap.com/black-hammers-free-hopped-up-trivia-night-every-wednes
 day-144/\nSource: Funcheap SF
