 ter Hayes occupies the studio\, weaponizing tenant law to drain their fina
 nces and sanity.\n\nAbout Floating Features\n\nSan Francisco Legacy Busine
 sses Red and White Fleet and The Roxie are partnering to turn the hybrid e
 lectric vessel Enhydra into a sailing cinema for a limited run of nighttim
 e film cruises on the Bay. Join us this autumn for a 2-hour twilight cruis
 e and a feature film handpicked by the Roxie. Our electric vessel means no
  engine noise and a totally unique al fresco movie experience.\n\nFull sch
 edule available here.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 42m\n\nYear\n\n1990\n\nDirector\n\n
