DESCRIPTION:THE POETRY & SONG OF LEONARD COHEN\n\nSwedish American Hall\nF
 riday\, November 6\n7:30PM\n\nBay Area poets and singer/songwriters honor 
 and explore\nthe words and music of the late troubadour\, Leonard Cohen.\n
 \nFeaturing:\nDevorah Major\, Josiah Luis Alderete\,\nBobby Coleman\, and 
 more tba.\n\nJoin us on the eve of the 10th anniversary of Leonard's passi
 ng for a heartfelt celebration of the legacy of Cohen at the 2026 San Fran
 cisco Leonard Cohen Festival. Bay Area poets and singer/songwriters will h
 onor his profound words and timeless music. Enjoy an evening of creativity
 \, connection\, and reflection as we explore the rich impact of Cohen's ar
 tistry. Full lineup coming soon!\n\n$45\nSF Leonard Cohen Festival Present
 s\n\nTickets: https://www.sfleonardcohenfest.com/nov-6-poetry-song\nDetail
 s: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/6/the-poetry-song-of-leonard-cohen-
 tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
