DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Presidio Tunnel Tops for a family-friendly Día
  de los Muertos & Diwali event in the park. Celebrated annually in the fal
 l season\, these two distinct cultural observances come together in a nati
 onal park to honor South Asian and Latinx traditions. Designed intentional
 ly as a celebration and a learning opportunity\, attendees are invited to 
 participate in a wide range of activities that include arts and crafts\, s
 torytelling\, cultural dance\, song\, and a fire ceremony\, and learn abou
 t social and environmental justice issues in both cultures.\n\nFree\n\nTic
 kets: https://presidio.gov/explore/events/dia-de-los-muertos-and-diwali-fe
 stival\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/7/dia-de-los-muertos-
