DESCRIPTION:Thrive CityEnjoy a free outdoor screening of Toy Story 5 at Th
 rive City on San Francisco’s largest plaza board. Attendees are encourag
 ed to bring blankets and enjoy family-friendly movie-themed activities and
  a photo opportunity. The movie begins at 1PM\, and space is limited to fi
 rst-come\, first-served. Parking is available at the Chase Center Garage\,
  and attendees should prepare for chilly weather.\nOriginal Event Descript
 ion:\n_Event: Blankets & Blockbusters: Toy Story 5 Venue: Thrive City Addr
 ess: 1 Warriors Way\, San Francisco\, CA 94158 Start: 2026-11-08T12:00:00 
 End: 2026-11-08T15:00:00 Cost: Free Organizer: Thrive City Enjoy a showing
  of Toy Story 5 on our plaza boardThrive City is rolling out the red carpe
 t and invites you to B.Y.O. Blanket for the Bay Area’s biggest movie scr
 een experience! Bring your family and friends to watch Toy Story 5 from ou
 r plaza board. Snap a pic at our photo op and explore our other movie-them
 ed activities! The movie will begin at 1PM.Make sure to bring something wa
 rm as the weather can get a little chilly!Parking is now available seven d
 ays a week at the Chase Center Garage (CCG) located at 99 Warriors Way. Vi
