SUMMARY:Japanese Tea Garden’s Free Admission Hour (Golden Gate Park)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T100000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638092@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Japanese Tea Garden’s Free Admission Hour (Golden Gate Park)
 \nJapanese Tea Garden\nThe Japanese Tea Garden provides visitors from arou
 nd the world with an opportunity to experience the natural beauty\, tranqu
 ility\, and harmony of a Japanese-style garden in the heart of San Francis
 co’s Golden Gate Park.\nOriginally created as a “Japanese Village” e
 xhibit for the 1894 California Midwinter International Exposition\, the Ja
 panese Tea Garden endures as one of the most popular attractions in San Fr
 ancisco\, featuring classic elements such as an arched drum bridge\, pagod
 as\, stone lanterns\, stepping stone paths\, native Japanese plants\, sere
 ne koi ponds\, and a zen garden. Cherry blossom trees bloom throughout the
  garden in March and April.\nAdmission to the Japanese Tea Garden is free 
 for San Francisco residents with valid ID. Free hours for everyone (even n
 on-residents) are 9-10 am every Monday\, Wednesday and Friday.\n\nPlease n
 ote that hours and costs change frequently.\nJapanese Tea Garden\n75 Hagiw
 ara Tea Garden\, Golden Gate Park\, SF\nFREE for San Francisco Residents w
 / ID\nFREE for Everyone from 9-10 am on Mondays\, Wednesdays and Fridays\n
 Non Resident Fees\nAdults: $12-16 (depends on season)\n(February – Novem
 ber) $14\n(December – January) $12\n(Weekends year-round) $16\nSeniors (
 ages 65+ w/ID) $7\nYouth (ages 12-17) $7\nChildren (ages 5-11) $3\nChildre
 n (under 5) FREE\nHours Of Operation\nLast entry 30 minutes before closing
 \nSpring – Summer Hours\nMarch – October\n9am – 5:45pm\nFall – Win
 ter Hours\nNovembe...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.japaneseteagardensf.
 com/vist\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/japanese-tea-gardens-free-admis
 sion-hour-golden-gate-park-448/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/japane
 seteagarden-scaled-e1595352236641.jpeg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Japanese Tea Garden\, 75 Hagiwara Tea Garden Dr\, San Francisco\,
  CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/japanese-tea-gardens-free-admission-hour-golde
 n-gate-park-448/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Programa de gestión de contingencias en español
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T113000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17648821@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:¿Le interesa cambiar\, reducir\, reevaluar o dejar de consumi
 r estimulantes como la metanfetamina o la cocaína?\n\nOfrecemos un progra
 ma de gestión de contingencias en español en nuestra agencia asociada\, 
 el Proyecto Gubbio.\n\nEste programa es un programa de refuerzo positivo d
 e 12 semanas/24 sesiones con servicios médicos\, asesoramiento individual
 \, gestión de casos y grupo de apoyo\, y todos los servicios se brindan e
 n español.\n\nPara obtener más información o unirse al grupo\, comuníq
 uese con Maricruz al 415-632-9722 o envíe un correo electrónico a mmoren
 o@sfaf.org.\n\n___________\n\nContingency management program in Spanish\n\
 nInterested in changing\, reducing\, re-evaluating\, or stopping your use 
 of stimulants such as meth or cocaine?\n\nWe offer a contingency managemen
 t program in Spanish at our partner agency\, the Gubbio Project.\n\nThis p
 rogram is a positive reinforcement 12 week/24-session program with medical
  services\, individual counseling\, case management\, and support group wi
 th all services provided in Spanish.\n\nFor more information or to join th
 e group\, please contact Maricruz at 415-632-9722 or mmoreno@sfaf.org.\n\n
 Tickets: https://resources.sfaf.org/event/programa-de-gestion-de-contingen
 cias-en-espanol/2026-11-09/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/
 9/programa-de-gestion-de-contingencias-en-espanol-tickets\nSource: DoTheBa
 y
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:San Francisco AIDS Foundation\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/9/programa-de-gestion-de-contingen
 cias-en-espanol-tickets
END:VEVENT
