DESCRIPTION:On Friday\, November 13\, from 5–7 p.m.\, Fulton Plaza will 
 come alive beneath the dazzling Spectra lights for the Holiday Season Perf
 orming Arts Showcase\, a celebration bringing together some of downtown’
 s most exciting performing arts organizations for one unforgettable evenin
 g.\nGuests will be treated to a dynamic lineup of live performances of wha
 t’s on stage this season. Expect short works from the San Francisco Oper
 a\, San Francisco Ballet\, the African American Shakespeare Company\, the 
 San Francisco Philharmonic and RAW Dance\, and more. From powerful voices 
 and sweeping orchestral music to captivating movement and theatrical perfo
 rmances\, the showcase offers a little bit of everything — and is a memo
 rable way to launch the holiday season.\nThis event is free\, and no ticke
 t required to attend.\nAlso be sure to visit the adjacent food trucks and 
 bar\, and visit with the arts organizations to learn more about what they
 ’re bringing to the stage Fall 2026-Winter 2027.\n\nDetails: https://sfc
 iviccenter.org/event/holiday-season-performing-arts-showcase/\nSource: SF 
 Civic Center
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T172218Z
