BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:RØZ
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17732440@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Monster Energy Outbreak Tour & Goldenvoice Present RØZ: SE ES
 TÁ HACIENDO TARDE\n\nArtist Presale: Wednesday\, August 12th at 10am PT\n
 \nRegister Here for Presale Access: https://laylo.com/rozwavvv/m/fyu9pY\n\
 nArtist and producer duo RØZ\, comprised of Manolo Cabrera and Hugo Lara\
 , has rapidly emerged as one of the most innovative forces in Mexico’s e
 lectronic music renaissance. In less than three years\, the project has ev
 olved from digital experimentation to selling out major venues\, redefinin
 g the expectations of Latin electronic music with a fluid\, boundary-break
 ing sonic identity.\n\nManolo Cabrera began his artistic journey inspired 
 by the cinematic world of large-scale electronic festivals – specificall
 y\, the Tomorrowland films that first awakened his fascination with dance 
 music. Early explorations led him through trap\, Tropical House\, and Futu
 re Bass\, releasing early work on SoundCloud as he developed his voice.\n\
 nHugo Lara’s path started in classical music. At just four years old\, h
 e played violin to the works of Italian composer Antonio Vivaldi. In his a
 dolescence\, artists like Skrillex pulled him toward EDM\, prompting him t
 o experiment with production through GarageBand – an entry point that ev
 entually enabled his first collaborations with Manolo.\n\nThe two met in h
 igh school\, each maintaining their solo projects while constantly exchang
 ing ideas and feedback. “He created sounds with synths that I didn’t k
 now how to make\,” Manolo recalls\, while Hugo admired the originality i
 n M...\n\n18+\nMonster Energy Outbreak Tour\, Goldenvoice\, & CMN Present:
  SE ESTÁ HACIENDO TARDE\n\nTickets: https://www.axs.com/events/1556908/ro
 z-tickets?skin=warfield&src=AEGLIVE_WWRFLSFO022715VEN001?cid=usaffdostuff\
 nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/roz-tickets\nSource: DoTh
 eBay
GEO:37.7827039;-122.4103578
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/33903079/cdc7f178-17a8-4678-940b-cf1422c6fc72.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Warfield\, 982 Market St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/roz-tickets
END:VEVENT
