 ’s delightfully quirky score live with the film on the big screen.\n\nKi
 ds’ Tickets Half Off!\n\nPlease note that we do not allow children under
  3 at any performance\, except for our Music for Families and Deck the Hal
 l programs. Everyone entering Davies Symphony Hall\, regardless of age\, m
 ust have a ticket. Children under the age of 12 must be seated with an acc
 ompanying adult.\n\nArtists\n\nSarah Hicks\, Conductor\nSan Francisco Symp
 hony\n\nProgram\n\nDanny Elfman\, Composer\nHenry Selick\, Director\n\nThe
  Film Series is presented in honor of Misty Tyree\, whose remarkable legac
 y gift ensures her lasting commitment to the San Francisco Symphony and it
 s artistic mission.\n\nThis concert is presented in partnership with SF Ar
 ts Commission.\n\nFilm with Live Orchestra\n\nTickets: https://sfsymphony.
 org/Buy-Tickets/2026-27/The-Nightmare-Before-Christmas\nDetails: https://d
