SUMMARY:District 10 Bayview Family Summit
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T133000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1634398@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Kids Families
DESCRIPTION:San Francisco Department of Children\, Youth & Their Families 
 (DCYF)\n\nThis is Your City. This is Your Voice. This is Your Future. Shar
 e your story about growing up and raising your family in San Francisco.\n\
 nEvery family has a story. Every voice matters. Please share yours.\nJoin 
 us for the District 10 Bayview Family Summit! The This Is Your City: Famil
 y Summit Series invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and communi
 ty members from across San Francisco to help shape the future of our city.
 \n\nSaturday\, Dec. 5\, 2026\, 11:00 a.m. – 1:30 p.m.\nSoutheast Communi
 ty Center\, ● 1550 Evans Ave\, SF\, CA 94124\n\nFree food\, childcare\, 
 and interpretation are provided. Please note all interpretation requests m
 ust be made 48 hours or more prior to the Family Summit.\nWho should atten
 d? Everyone is welcome. This event highlights District 10\, but you can at
 tend any Family Summit that fits your schedule.\nWhy are we gathering? The
  Family Summit Series is part of San Francisco’s first Citywide Communit
 y Needs Assessment. Through conversations with families across the city\, 
 we’re learning what matters most to children\, youth\, young adults\, an
 d families. What we learn will help improve future planning\, programs\, a
 nd services.\nWhether you’ve lived in San Francisco your whole life or r
 ecently made it your home\, your experiences and ideas matter.\nDistrict 1
 0 Neighborhoods include: Potrero Hill\, Central Waterfront\, Dogpatch\, Ba
 yview-Hunters Point\, Bayview Heights\, India Basin\, Silver Terrace\, Can
 dlestick...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/district-10-b
 ayview-family-summit-tickets-1996550486250?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: htt
 ps://sf.funcheap.com/district-10-bayview-family-summit/\nSource: Funcheap 
 SF
